# Do not open localhost

After implementing or fixing UI, layout, styling, routing, or data changes, do not open the local app in the browser.

- Do not navigate to `localhost`, `127.0.0.1`, or any local dev URL.
- Do not take screenshots of the running site or click through it to verify a change.
- Finish the code change, report what changed, and leave visual checks to the user.

Static checks (types, lint, unit tests) are still fine when they do not open a browser.
